> pbot spawn n8 0 160 0 minecraft:overworld creative
count \[zq\] chunk 0 0 >= 11
reject (?i)Unknown dimension|no such dimension|\[zq\] error
> locate structure creativeworldgen:sky_island
waitlog (?:The nearest creativeworldgen:sky_island is at|Could not find) 300
